:''Not to be confused with [[Metal One Horn]].''
'''Cyberhorn''' (Japanese: サイバーX ''Saibā X'', '''Cyber X''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[One Horn]] that appears in [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]].

