==Trivia==
*Like [[Metal One Horn]], Cyberhorn's Japanese name, Saibā X, is a pun containing ''sai'', meaning "rhinoceros".
*Cyberhorn's English description is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Terminator (character concept)|Terminator]], a stiff cyborg and killing machine.
**Despite this reference, Cyberhorn is not a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy, as [[Metal One Horn]] already existed when he was added. Perhaps he was too slow even for that.
*Cyberhorn's walking animation has a short period of 4 frames where part of his front horn is cut off.

